  "title": "Sequans Announces Conference Call to Review Second Quarter 2026 Results",
  "summary": "PARIS, France — July 21, 2026 — Sequans Communications S.A. (NYSE: SQNS), a leading provider of 5G/4G cellular IoT semiconductor solutions, will release its financial results for the second quarter of 2026 on Tuesday, August 4, 2026, during pre-market hours. Following the announcement, Sequans’ management will host a conference call at 8:00 a.m. ET. Conference Call […]",
